<div class="wrap">
  <p class="brand">Whetlog</p>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="meta">Effective date: August 29, 2026 · Last updated: August 29, 2026</p>

  <div class="summary"><strong>Your log stays on your device.</strong> Whetlog does not require an account and does not collect, transmit, or sell your personal information or the contents of your log.</div>

  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>Whetlog (“the app”, “we”) is provided by <strong>Softgrove</strong>, an independent developer based in Japan. Contact: <a href="mailto:support@softgrove.app">support@softgrove.app</a>.</p>

  <h2>What the app stores</h2>
  <p>You may record blades, whetstones, sharpening sessions, touch-ups, notes, optional photos, and related details such as dates, grit, duration, and ratings. This information is stored only on your device in Apple’s on-device SwiftData database. We do not receive it, and the app does not provide account sync or a cloud backup service.</p>
  <p>You control your data. You can delete entries in the app, and deleting the app removes its local app data. If you choose to export or share a blade card or CSV file, you decide where that file goes through Apple’s system share sheet.</p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p><strong>We do not collect information from you.</strong> Whetlog has no user accounts, analytics SDKs, advertising SDKs, tracking, or developer-operated data collection service. It does not send anonymous usage events, log contents, photos, or device identifiers to Softgrove.</p>

  <h2>Purchases and network connections</h2>
  <p>Whetlog offers an optional Lifetime unlock as a one-time purchase. Payments, product availability, purchase restoration, and entitlement verification are handled by Apple through StoreKit and the App Store. We do not receive or store your payment information. Apart from Apple’s purchase-related services and links you choose to open, Whetlog does not make network requests to Softgrove or another server.</p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>Whetlog is not directed to children under 13 (or the minimum age in your region). Because the app does not collect personal information, we do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

  <h2>Third parties</h2>
  <p>We do not sell, rent, or share personal information. Whetlog contains no third-party analytics or advertising SDKs and does not track you across apps or websites.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy. Material changes will be reflected here with a new “Last updated” date.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions: <a href="mailto:support@softgrove.app">support@softgrove.app</a>.</p>

  <p class="foot">See the <a href="terms">Terms of Use</a>.</p>
</div>
